From 908223fce4bde491a98c2151d64ec22a7c34d6d7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Chong <achong@meta.com>
Date: Mon, 4 Aug 2025 09:45:47 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] add cfg for darwin build - nix crate

Summary:
# Motivation:
libnix is needed in cuttlefish host utils. It can be built with the right cfgs
# Overview:
- set darwin cfg correctly

Test Plan:
```
. build/envsetup.sh
 lunch aosp_cf_arm64_phone-userdebug
 m out/host/darwin-x86/cvd-host_package.tar.gz -k &> ~/build.logs.txt
```
---
 crates/nix/Android.bp | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/crates/nix/Android.bp b/crates/nix/Android.bp
index 2a9c274a..cb3c16b0 100644
--- a/crates/nix/Android.bp
+++ b/crates/nix/Android.bp
@@ -68,6 +68,12 @@ rust_library {
                 "linux_android",
             ],
         },
+        darwin: {
+            cfgs: [
+                "apple_targets",
+                "bsd"
+            ]
+        },
     },
 
 }
